By [[2025]], Michael is still happily married to Amanda while their children have moved out, leaving Michael and Amanda as "empty nesters" with too much time on their hands. Michael also retains the status of a famous Vinewood film producer he gained after the release of ''Meltdown''. He is currently the owner of film production company [[De Santa (company)|De Santa]], which is responsible for the production of several movies, including ''[[Drive Fast, Die Slow]]''. De Santa film productions have gained immense popularity in Vinewood, with artists such as [[Zelma Bosch]] attempting to get their pieces of art into Michael's films as props.

